  daisyDialogueLines:
  - So what happened after everything went dark?
  - I dont know.
  - All I saw was something coming out of gurt and then everything went dark and
    I was back in bed.
  - After I awoke I tried finding anyone in the apaertment.
  - And... found.. the remains of kosmo and trevor....
  - Oh god..
  daisyIsNPCSpeaking: 
